 "remarks": "Enjoy effortless one-level living in this sparkling, fresh and sunny end unit at the desirable Old Greenwich Gables. Set amid meticulously maintained grounds, this inviting residence offers an exceptional lifestyle with premier community amenities, including a pool, squash court, fitness center and clubhouse. Just a short walk to all that charming Old Greenwich has to offer including its boutique shops, cafes and popular restaurants. Freshly painted and updated with new appliances, new carpeting in the bedroom and a new HVAC system. Ideally located just moments from the train, Binney Park, the Civic Center and Greenwich Point Beach. A wonderful opportunity to embrace the best of Old Greenwich living! Agent is related to owner.",
